!Name: p540forwrake
!C A c/3 period 540 forward rake.
!C This is produced by period tripling two period 180 glider streams.
!C The period multiplication reaction uses a period 21 frothing spaceship
!C whose period is modified by the impacts to be compatible with the glider
!C streams.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
